@startuml recommendation-service-simple
!theme mono

title 추천·이력 서비스(recommendation-service) - 클래스 다이어그램 (요약)
' 작성자: 홍길동 (아키) + 한승우 (마법사)

package "com.unicorn.lunchpick.recommendation" {

    package "controller" {
        class RecommendationController
        class MealController
        class HistoryController
        class InsightController
    }

    package "service" {
        interface RecommendationService
        class RecommendationServiceImpl
        interface MealRecordService
        class MealRecordServiceImpl
        interface FeedbackService
        class FeedbackServiceImpl
        interface InsightService
        class InsightServiceImpl
        interface TasteLearningService
        class TasteLearningServiceImpl
        class TasteVectorCalculator
        class ContextCollector
        class CacheService
    }

    package "repository" {
        interface RecommendationRepository
        interface MealRecordRepository
        interface FeedbackRepository
    }

    package "repository/entity" {
        class RecommendationEntity
        class MealRecordEntity
        class FeedbackEntity
        class PreferenceVectorEntity
        class LearningMessageEntity
    }

    package "client" {
        class AiPipelineClient
        class MemberServiceClient
        class WeatherApiClient
        class MapApiClient
    }

    package "dto/request" {
        class AcceptRecommendationRequest
        class RejectRecommendationRequest
        class RefreshRecommendationsRequest
        class CreateMealRequest
        class UpdateMealRequest
        class FeedbackRequest
    }

    package "dto/response" {
        class TodayRecommendationsResponse
        class RecommendationReasonResponse
        class AcceptRecommendationResponse
        class RejectRecommendationResponse
        class MealResponse
        class FeedbackResponse
        class MealHistoryResponse
        class InsightsResponse
    }
}

' Controller -> Service
RecommendationController --> RecommendationService
MealController --> MealRecordService
MealController --> FeedbackService
HistoryController --> MealRecordService
InsightController --> InsightService

' Service Implementation
RecommendationServiceImpl ..|> RecommendationService
RecommendationServiceImpl --> RecommendationRepository
RecommendationServiceImpl --> CacheService
RecommendationServiceImpl --> ContextCollector
RecommendationServiceImpl --> AiPipelineClient
RecommendationServiceImpl --> MemberServiceClient

MealRecordServiceImpl ..|> MealRecordService
MealRecordServiceImpl --> MealRecordRepository
MealRecordServiceImpl --> CacheService

FeedbackServiceImpl ..|> FeedbackService
FeedbackServiceImpl --> FeedbackRepository
FeedbackServiceImpl --> MealRecordRepository

InsightServiceImpl ..|> InsightService
InsightServiceImpl --> MealRecordRepository
InsightServiceImpl --> FeedbackRepository

TasteLearningServiceImpl ..|> TasteLearningService
TasteLearningServiceImpl --> FeedbackRepository
TasteLearningServiceImpl --> MemberServiceClient
TasteLearningServiceImpl --> AiPipelineClient
TasteLearningServiceImpl --> TasteVectorCalculator

ContextCollector --> MemberServiceClient
ContextCollector --> WeatherApiClient
ContextCollector --> MealRecordRepository

RecommendationRepository ..> RecommendationEntity
MealRecordRepository ..> MealRecordEntity
FeedbackRepository ..> FeedbackEntity

note as N1
  **Controller API 매핑표**
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  **RecommendationController**
  GET    /api/v1/recommendations/today                    오늘의 추천 3개 조회
  GET    /api/v1/recommendations/{recommendationId}/reason 추천 이유 상세 확인
  POST   /api/v1/recommendations/{recommendationId}/accept 추천 수락
  POST   /api/v1/recommendations/{recommendationId}/reject 추천 거절 및 대체 추천 요청
  POST   /api/v1/recommendations/refresh                  추천 전체 새로고침

  **MealController**
  POST   /api/v1/meals                                    식사 완료 원탭 기록
  PUT    /api/v1/meals/{mealId}                           식사 기록 수정
  DELETE /api/v1/meals/{mealId}                           식사 기록 취소 (30초 이내)
  POST   /api/v1/meals/{mealId}/feedback                  식사 피드백 제출

  **HistoryController**
  GET    /api/v1/history/timeline                         식사 이력 타임라인 조회

  **InsightController**
  GET    /api/v1/insights                                 취향 인사이트 리포트 조회
end note

@enduml
